<script setup lang="ts">
import { ref } from 'vue'
import { withBase } from 'vitepress'
const role = ref('admin')
const tabs = [{ key: 'admin', text: '管理员' }, { key: 'merchant', text: '普通商户' }]
function move(e: KeyboardEvent) { if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'ArrowRight') { role.value = role.value === 'admin' ? 'merchant' : 'admin'; e.preventDefault(); (e.currentTarget as HTMLElement).parentElement?.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(`[data-role="${role.value}"]`)?.focus() } }
</script>
<template><section class="role-quickstart" aria-label="按角色快速开始"><strong class="quickstart-title">从正确的入口开始</strong><div class="quickstart-inner"><div class="role-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="选择使用身份"><button v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.key" role="tab" :id="`role-tab-${tab.key}`" :data-role="tab.key" :aria-selected="role === tab.key" :aria-controls="`role-panel-${tab.key}`" :tabindex="role === tab.key ? 0 : -1" @click="role = tab.key" @keydown="move">{{ tab.text }}</button></div><div v-if="role === 'admin'" id="role-panel-admin" class="quickstart-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="role-tab-admin"><p>打开站点 <code>/admin/login</code>，使用管理员账号登录。</p><ol><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/payment-channels.html')">配置支付方式与通道</a></li><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/merchant-management.html')">设置用户组并开通商户</a></li><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/transactions.html')">核对首笔收款与回调</a></li></ol></div><div v-else id="role-panel-merchant" class="quickstart-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="role-tab-merchant"><p>打开运营方提供的 <code>/merchant/login</code>，本人登录。</p><ol><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/account-security.html')">取得 API 信息并完成账户设置</a></li><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/transactions.html')">接入收款并核对订单</a></li><li><a :href="withBase('/modules/settlements.html')">设置收款账户并申请提现</a></li></ol></div></div><p class="quickstart-note">每个功能模块都同时说明管理员与商户的入口、操作步骤和结果核对。</p></section></template>
